367 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (REVELATION follows the last months of TEODORO VELLA, an inmate at the Ucciardone Prison in Sicily, as he contemplates suicide and rethinks the responsibility of his family in his life. He reflects on his role in Cosa Nostra \(the mafia\) and his relationship with both of his brothers, eventually realizing that in spite of the significance of the family unit in his society, violence, on large and small scales, can irrevocably separate such relationships and result in severe loneliness.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
